# Project Objectives

The primary objectives of the project are:

### Wildlife Detection

Identify and classify wildlife species using AI-enabled camera systems.

### Movement Tracking

Track animal movement across multiple detection nodes to estimate direction and behaviour.

### Autonomous Investigation

Deploy unmanned aerial vehicles to investigate and confirm detections.

### Long-Term Observation

Utilise perch-based drone operation to maximise observation time while minimising power consumption.

### Scalability

Develop a modular architecture capable of expanding from a single-property deployment to regional conservation applications.

